    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Shao Yuqi, a rising high jump star, is winning hearts not only with her performances but also with her confidence. At the 2025 Chinese National Athletics "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Championships",
            "zh": "全国田径锦标赛"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", the 23-year-old athlete "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "claimed",
            "ref": "v-claim"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the women’s high jump title with a jump of 1.90 metres. A video of her winning jump has earned more than 3 million likes online."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Shao’s journey in sports started in primary school. During a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "tryout",
            "zh": "选拔赛"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", she easily cleared a one-metre "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "bar",
            "ref": "v-bar"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", and her teachers quickly recognised her talent. But not everyone believed in her. Some worried that "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "pursuing",
            "ref": "v-pursue"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " sports would limit her future. Luckily, her father and coach always stood by her side. In 2020, Shao proved the "
          },
          {
            "t": "underline",
            "v": "doubters"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " wrong when she was admitted to Tsinghua University, one of China’s top universities."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "As Shao’s popularity grows, she has also faced "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "criticism",
            "ref": "v-criticism"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Some "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "netizens",
            "zh": "网民"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " compared her result to the world record and questioned whether she should be proud of winning. Shao responded calmly, explaining that the level of Chinese women’s high jump is improving and that athletes need encouragement, not negative comments. “If I ever compete at the Olympics, just being there would be a victory,” she said."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Shao also challenges outdated ideas about how female athletes should look. Like fellow track star Wu Yanni, she wears makeup, "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "braids her hair",
            "zh": "编辫子"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", and does her nails during competitions. Some critics say that female athletes now look like they are in a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "beauty pageant",
            "zh": "选美比赛"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Shao disagreed. “This is "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "ridiculous",
            "zh": "可笑的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ",” she said. “It’s our body, and we decide how to present ourselves.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "“We are strong, and we are beautiful women,” she added confidently. Her words have inspired her fans. “Beauty does not need to be hidden, and strength does not require "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "compromise",
            "zh": "妥协"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ",” one supporter wrote."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
